{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "309"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天竺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "震旦"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七卷取意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣六祖大師。東地宗上兼修念佛。權輿於師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣馬祖一禪師。乃萬世叢林之大宗也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或曰宗門之十念。藏本于兹焉。清規雖有秉炬佛事。而寶山本願之乃至十念也。故云別\n無所為矣。又下火之事。未見於上祖之錄。而見于自得錄也。又清規無白衣之念誦。永覺錄等也亡僧之下火耳矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師法眼三世也。同歸序稱師為阿彌陀佛化身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採往生集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "武庫曰趙\n州和尚舍利。多至萬粒。又曰真淨禪師舍利。大如菽。五色晶瑩而又堅剛也。大慧試之。置於鉄砧。舉槌擊之。砧槌俱陷。而\n舍利無損。慧讚曰。豈非平昔履踐明白見道。超詣所致耶也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于淨土或問。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于竹󰈧三筆\n○按善導之書。日課十萬者多矣。又有古師多許疾而止要常念可考矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于蓮宗寶鑑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今時要路在兹可修可歡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于淨土旨訣○謂今時此屬多矣。痛惜而已。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于歸元直指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲門五世孫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採道衍善人詠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于淨土指歸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣開先暹禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于歸元直指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲門六世孫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採往生集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師雲門七世也嗣長蘆夫禪師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于蓮宗寶鑑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採龍舒淨土文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師雲門七世也嗣圓照本禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採往生集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣圓照本禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于樂邦文類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣圓照本禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于樂邦文類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師曹洞十世本朝永平道元禪師者師五世孫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採道衍善人詠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于淨土或問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于歸元直指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于蓮宗寶鑑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師臨濟十世也嗣黃龍心禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採往生集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于淨土或問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于五燈會元"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣草堂清禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採龍舒淨土文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲門九世孫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採道衍善人詠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣佛眼遠禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于樂邦文類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊岐十二世也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採往生集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于雲棲疏鈔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于歸元直指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣雲峰高禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于策進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣中峰本禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拙菴禪師法嗣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛之行有三種焉。一者日課。二者別時。三者臨終\n也。謂日課臨終。是窮為緊要。別時須揣其力量以行之矣。日課亦須隨機之便。以及於百聲。乃至十萬聲也。然\n一生如實行去。而臨終正念念佛終。則決定往生。決定成佛焉。是全無疑矣。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于淨土或問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于歸元直指"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師中峰三世也嗣靈隱明禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採文憲護法錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師大慧五世也嗣徑山端禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採護法錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣東林際禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于策進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣白蓮安禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于禪關策進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣大崗澄禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于禪關策進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師嗣壽堂松禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于禪關策進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師禪寶峰宣禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于禪關策進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採直指集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上行脚求師開示序略"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師曹洞三十二世也嗣壽昌經禪師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于禪警語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師曹洞三十二世也嗣壽昌經禪師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于行業曲記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨土教源"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛正信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前有\n理持之語略於此而不取"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛正行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "臨終正念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂承天簡。雲門五世孫。出得悟二人。真如哲。臨濟九世孫。出得悟二十九人。海印信。臨濟九世孫。出得悟六人矣。言其等\n則若五祖戒。草堂清。有其退轉之事。見于他帙焉。皆是宗門哲匠。也而既有退墮。則何況於今日僧俗乎。不可\n不辨也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華嚴法華"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上淨土辯疑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "永覺禪師三十年開堂得師一人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師續善導之偈演八首取此末之偈。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一脈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮池大戒之祖翁也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師支那人。嗣隱元琦禪師。住日城黃檗山。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師曹洞正傳第十四世也。嗣天童淨禪師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採隨聞記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師聖一國師第三世也。嗣東山湛照禪師。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師關山派也。住奧州松島瑞巖寺。即故法心國師之道塲。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採盲安杖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採反古集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採隨鞍橋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "○謂此佛本願不可思議功德。或曰巧示因於往生。果悟無生是也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採反古集殘書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有儒輩。初悟禪。後歸念佛者。以下載七人。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上六人共採于往生集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名石願居士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香光子。對于禪人破合論。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如龍舒居士淨土文。大慧禪師跋曰。龍舒王盧中日休。博覽群書之餘。留心佛乘。以利人為己任。真火中蓮也。\n佛言自未得度。先度人。菩薩發心也。又為霖禪師序。曰居士少業儒。為國學進士。博學能文。嘗解六經語孟\n老莊。不蹈襲前人一字。中年恍然自悟曰。皆綺語也。乃棄去專奉淨土之教。禮誦不輟。發願往生。臨終見佛來\n迎。屹然立化。其存日本諸經論。著淨土文十卷諭世非佛菩薩乘願而來。攝受眾生歸而淨土。能若是\n乎。（已上）又如雲棲袾宏大師者從儒入佛盡教悟禪。而入念佛門。兼與戒律。修扶教禪。執釋氏師表萬\n世。不可不以法也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採念佛集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "採于咸念法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "錄于\n\n一言芳談"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼有五世出家之事此略"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "博士學哿即\n太子外典之師也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乙亥"}
